&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center; line-height: 1"&gt;支給総額&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center; line-height: 1"&gt;（百万円）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
